"}},{"id":207,"type":"H3OptionalVideo","pos":[1260,0],"size":[367.5533203125,102],"flags":{},"order":21,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"video"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"upload","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"frames","name":"frames","type":"IMAGE","links":[65]},{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"AUDIO","links":[66]}],"title":"MOTION / CAMERA REFERENCE VIDEO - optional","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"H3OptionalVideo"},"widgets_values":["none","image"],"widgets_values_named":{"video":"none","upload":"image"}},{"id":208,"type":"H3OptionalAudio","pos":[1260,162],"size":[324.2681640625,58],"flags":{},"order":22,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"audio"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"AUDIO","name":"AUDIO","type":"AUDIO","links":[67]}],"title":"VOICE SAMPLE (voice to imitate) - optional","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"H3OptionalAudio"},"widgets_values":["none"],"widgets_values_named":{"audio":"none"}},{"id":209,"type":"H3OptionalImage","pos":[1260,280],"size":[381.9087890625,82],"flags":{},"order":23,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"image"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"upload","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"IMAGE","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[107]}],"title":"FIRST FRAME (video starts on this image) - optional","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"H3OptionalImage"},"widgets_values":["none","image"],"widgets_values_named":{"image":"none","upload":"image"}},{"id":210,"type":"H3OptionalImage","pos":[1640,0],"size":[373.6236328125,82],"flags":{},"order":24,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"image"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"upload","name":"upload","type":"IMAGEUPLOAD","widget":{"name":"upload"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"IMAGE","name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":[108]}],"title":"LAST FRAME (video ends on this image) - optional","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"H3OptionalImage"},"widgets_values":["none","image"],"widgets_values_named":{"image":"none","upload":"image"}},{"id":211,"type":"H3OptionalAudio","pos":[1640,142],"size":[348.3921875,58],"flags":{},"order":25,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","type":"COMBO","widget":{"name":"audio"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"AUDIO","name":"AUDIO","type":"AUDIO","links":[109]}],"title":"VOICE TRACK (lips follow this audio) - optional","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"H3OptionalAudio"},"widgets_values":["none"],"widgets_values_named":{"audio":"none"}},{"id":212,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-895.8848184429089,-1.5721592325534313],"size":[580,1040],"flags":{},"order":26,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"properties":{},"widgets_values":["# H3 Director (quality first)\n\n**FINAL QUALITY is ON by default**: full model, 40 steps, no turbo LoRA, no VSA, high-quality video encode (CRF 16). About 8 min for a 5 s clip. Turn it OFF for a fast 4-step draft (about 1 min) to check framing and motion first.\n\n**Every reference slot is optional.** Leave a slot on **none** and it is skipped.\n- CHARACTER 1 / 2 / 3, OUTFIT, BACKGROUND / LOCATION, PROP / PRODUCT\n- MOTION / CAMERA REFERENCE VIDEO, VOICE SAMPLE\n- FIRST FRAME / LAST FRAME, VOICE TRACK (lips follow this audio)\n\nImage and video slots have an upload button. For the two audio slots, copy the file into ComfyUI/input and press R.\n\n**Reference images matter most**: use sharp images of at least 1024 px with no watermark, logo or text. The model copies those into the video.\n\n**Prompt rules that fix the common problems**\n- Sharp background: \"Deep focus: the background stays sharp and detailed, no background blur, no bokeh.\"\n- Stable camera: \"Locked camera, no cuts, no zoom.\"\n- One action per clip, described step by step: \"she slowly stands up from the chair, then walks toward the door\". Sudden jumps come from asking for too much in 5 s.\n- Lips: put the words in quotes after \"Audio:\", one short sentence, and add \"realistic lip articulation, no exaggerated mouth opening\". For the best lip sync, give a VOICE TRACK and keep the face large.\n- Write \"the main character\", \"the background\" etc. The workflow adds the reference numbering for you (see FINAL PROMPT SENT TO THE MODEL).\n- 5-6 s clips hold best. Keep the seed fixed while changing the prompt."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"# H3 Director (quality first)\n\n**FINAL QUALITY is ON by default**: full model, 40 steps, no turbo LoRA, no VSA, high-quality video encode (CRF 16). About 8 min for a 5 s clip. Turn it OFF for a fast 4-step draft (about 1 min) to check framing and motion first.\n\n**Every reference slot is optional.** Leave a slot on **none** and it is skipped.\n- CHARACTER 1 / 2 / 3, OUTFIT, BACKGROUND / LOCATION, PROP / PRODUCT\n- MOTION / CAMERA REFERENCE VIDEO, VOICE SAMPLE\n- FIRST FRAME / LAST FRAME, VOICE TRACK (lips follow this audio)\n\nImage and video slots have an upload button. For the two audio slots, copy the file into ComfyUI/input and press R.\n\n**Reference images matter most**: use sharp images of at least 1024 px with no watermark, logo or text. The model copies those into the video.\n\n**Prompt rules that fix the common problems**\n- Sharp background: \"Deep focus: the background stays sharp and detailed, no background blur, no bokeh.\"\n- Stable camera: \"Locked camera, no cuts, no zoom.\"\n- One action per clip, described step by step: \"she slowly stands up from the chair, then walks toward the door\". Sudden jumps come from asking for too much in 5 s.\n- Lips: put the words in quotes after \"Audio:\", one short sentence, and add \"realistic lip articulation, no exaggerated mouth opening\". For the best lip sync, give a VOICE TRACK and keep the face large.\n- Write \"the main character\", \"the background\" etc. The workflow adds the reference numbering for you (see FINAL PROMPT SENT TO THE MODEL).\n- 5-6 s clips hold best. Keep the seed fixed while changing the prompt."},"color":"#432","bgcolor":"#653"}],"links":[[58,2,0,6,0,"CLIP"],[59,4,0,6,1,"VAE"],[60,5,0,6,2,"VAE"],[61,100,0,6,12,"STRING"],[62,103,0,6,13,"INT"],[63,104,0,6,14,"INT"],[64,110,1,6,15,"INT"],[65,207,0,6,9,"IMAGE"],[66,207,1,6,10,"AUDIO"],[67,208,0,6,11,"AUDIO"],[68,201,0,6,3,"IMAGE"],[69,202,0,6,4,"IMAGE"],[70,203,0,6,5,"IMAGE"],[71,204,0,6,6,"IMAGE"],[72,205,0,6,7,"IMAGE"],[73,206,0,6,8,"IMAGE"],[74,106,0,8,0,"INT"],[75,142,0,10,0,"MODEL"],[76,28,0,10,2,"INT"],[77,142,0,11,0,"MODEL"],[78,61,0,11,1,"CONDITIONING"],[79,8,0,12,0,"NOISE"],[80,11,0,12,1,"GUIDER"],[81,30,0,12,2,"SAMPLER"],[82,10,0,12,3,"SIGMAS"],[83,6,1,12,4,"LATENT"],[84,12,0,13,0,"LATENT"],[85,4,0,13,1,"VAE"],[86,12,0,14,0,"LATENT"],[87,5,0,14,1,"VAE"],[88,13,0,15,0,"IMAGE"],[89,14,0,15,1,"AUDIO"],[91,108,0,27,2,"BOOLEAN"],[92,29,0,27,0,"MODEL"],[93,1,0,27,1,"MODEL"],[94,108,0,28,2,"BOOLEAN"],[95,113,0,28,0,"INT"],[96,105,0,28,1,"INT"],[97,109,0,29,2,"BOOLEAN"],[98,143,0,29,0,"MODEL"],[99,144,0,29,1,"MODEL"],[100,108,0,30,2,"BOOLEAN"],[101,9,0,30,0,"SAMPLER"],[102,19,0,30,1,"SAMPLER"],[103,6,0,61,0,"CONDITIONING"],[104,6,1,61,1,"LATENT"],[105,4,0,61,2,"VAE"],[106,5,0,61,3,"VAE"],[107,209,0,61,4,"IMAGE"],[108,210,0,61,5,"IMAGE"],[109,211,0,61,6,"AUDIO"],[110,6,2,62,0,"STRING"],[112,27,0,142,0,"MODEL"],[113,1,0,143,0,"MODEL"],[114,143,0,144,0,"MODEL"],[90,15,0,16,0,"VIDEO"],[111,102,0,110,0,"FLOAT"]],"groups":[{"id":1,"title":"1. PROMPT AND SETTINGS","bounding":[-15,-80,470,1322],"color":"#3f789e","flags":{}},{"id":2,"title":"2. REFERENCES - all optional. Leave on \"none\" to skip.","bounding":[485,-80,1550,620],"color":"#8A8","flags":{}},{"id":3,"title":"3. MODEL (ref2va) - no need to touch","bounding":[2065,-80,438.9595703125001,2200],"col